{
  "info": {
    "name": "Resource Service",
    "description": "Resource Service (lab 4). Player requests go through the API Gateway ({{baseUrl}}, http://localhost:8080): run 'Auth (run first)' to register and log in; the gateway verifies the token and forwards the player as X-Player-Id with X-Caller: client. Service-to-service requests go through the Camus message broker ({{brokerUrl}}, http://localhost:8091) as /call/{service}/..., with X-Internal-Key (INTERNAL_KEY in the team .env, default changeme): the broker picks the least loaded healthy instance and calls it over gRPC (broker.v1.Endpoint). Operations: logs, metrics and the X-Caller rule. Events: published to broker topics, which deliver them to Resource at POST /internal/events (Endpoint.Deliver over gRPC).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth (run first)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register Player",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"demo{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"password\": \"hunter2hunter2\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('username', pm.response.json().username);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Log In",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"hunter2hunter2\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const cookie = pm.response.headers.get('Set-Cookie') || '';",
                  "const match = cookie.match(/access_token=([^;]+)/);",
                  "if (match) pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', match[1]);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('playerId', pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Gateway Health Check",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Events",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Player Registered",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Internal-Key",
                "value": "changeme"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{brokerUrl}}/topics/player.registered/events",
            "description": "Publishes player.registered to the broker, which delivers it to every subscriber (Resource and Base) at POST /internal/events, over gRPC (Endpoint.Deliver) when the instance registered a grpc_url. Resource creates zero balances for player 42; a repeated eventId is a no-op.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"eventId\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n  \"type\": \"player.registered\",\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"occurredAt\": \"2026-09-25T10:00:00Z\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"playerId\": 42,\n    \"username\": \"razvan\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Action Completed - chop_benches",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Internal-Key",
                "value": "changeme"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{brokerUrl}}/topics/game.action_completed/events",
            "description": "Publishes game.action_completed; the broker delivers it to Resource, which credits wood, then relays resource.gathered from its outbox back to the broker (Broker.Publish).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"eventId\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n  \"type\": \"game.action_completed\",\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"occurredAt\": \"2026-09-25T10:00:00Z\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"actionId\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n    \"sessionId\": \"7a90\",\n    \"playerId\": 42,\n    \"type\": \"chop_benches\",\n    \"roomId\": 3,\n    \"nodeId\": null,\n    \"completedAt\": \"2026-09-25T10:00:00Z\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
